arena), live performance metrics (output throughput, time-to-first-token) and per-token pricing into one comparable number. Pricing and metadata revalidate hourly; live performance updates on a 7-day rolling average. For the full weighting and refresh cadence see the \u003ca href=\\\"/methodology/llm-stats-score\\\"\u003eLLM Stats Score methodology\u003c/a\u003e. 335 canonical models are tracked across every major lab and inference provider.\"}}]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>